---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Booking terms" description="MotionHotel booking terms template."><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">STAY WELL</p><h1>Booking terms.</h1><p>Clear expectations make for an easier arrival.</p></section><section class="section prose legal-prose"><p class="legal-notice">Theme template only — adapt these terms to your property, booking process and jurisdiction, then obtain legal review before publishing.</p><h2>Reservations</h2><p>A reservation becomes binding only after confirmation by [Hotel name] or the selected booking provider. Add your accepted booking channels and confirmation process here.</p><h2>Check-in and check-out</h2><p>Check-in: [time]. Check-out: [time]. Add information for early arrivals, late departures and age requirements where applicable.</p><h2>Cancellation and changes</h2><p>State the applicable cancellation deadline, fees, no-show rules, refund timeline and how guests may request changes. Conditions can vary by rate and season.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>Describe deposit requirements, accepted payment methods, taxes, local fees and when the remaining balance is due.</p><h2>House rules</h2><p>Include your policies for smoking, pets, visitors, pool use, accessibility and damage to property.</p></section></BaseLayout>
